# Kompakt: the touch controller, which also reports the three keys under the screen.
# Same as Generic.kl for every key it declares; VIRTUAL gives the three keys the press vibration.
key 17    W
key 18    E
key 22    U
key 24    O
key 31    S
key 38    L
key 44    Z
key 46    C
key 47    V
key 50    M
key 103   DPAD_UP
key 105   DPAD_LEFT
key 106   DPAD_RIGHT
key 108   DPAD_DOWN
key 116   POWER
key 158   BACK         VIRTUAL
key 172   HOME         VIRTUAL
key 580   APP_SWITCH   VIRTUAL
